## 4. Non-Goals (Out of Scope for V1)

- IES profile *editor/viewer* (visual goniometric diagram)
- EEVEE/forward-mobile fallback (may silently ignore IES)
- IES-aware importance sampling for NEE (uniform cone sampling is sufficient initially)
- HDR preview thumbnails for IES profiles in the asset browser

