### 6.3 Layer 3 — IES File Parser

##### [NEW] [core/io/ies_file.h](file:///c:/Users/aiadmin/Desktop/RTX_path_tracing/core/io/ies_file.h)
##### [NEW] [core/io/ies_file.cpp](file:///c:/Users/aiadmin/Desktop/RTX_path_tracing/core/io/ies_file.cpp)

Direct port of the Cycles `IESFile` class ([intern/cycles/util/ies.h/cpp](file:///c:/Users/aiadmin/Desktop/blender_build/blender/intern/cycles/util/ies.h)):

```cpp
class IESFile {
public:
    enum PhotometricType {
        TYPE_C = 1,
        TYPE_B = 2,
        TYPE_A = 3,
    };

    bool load(const String &p_content);
    bool parse(const String &p_content);
    void process();
    void pack(float *p_data) const;
    int packed_size() const;
    void clear();

    bool is_valid() const { return !v_angles.is_empty(); }

private:
    Vector<float> v_angles;    // Vertical angles (radians, 0..π)
    Vector<float> h_angles;    // Horizontal angles (radians, 0..2π)
    Vector<Vector<float>> intensity;  // [h][v] grid

    void process_type_a();
    void process_type_b();
    void process_type_c();
};
```

**Key behaviors (matching Cycles):**

| Step | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `TILT=` marker | Find and skip tilt data |
| Header values | Lamp count, lumen, candela multiplier, angle counts, photometric type |
| Candela → Watts | `factor *= 0.0706650768394` (4π / 177.83 luminous efficacy of D65) |
| Type normalization | All types → Type C spherical coordinates |
| Angle conversion | Degrees → radians |
| Symmetry expansion | Half-profiles (0°–90°, 0°–180°) expanded to full 0°–360° |

**Packed data format (matches Cycles exactly):**

```
[ h_num (float-encoded int) ]
[ v_num (float-encoded int) ]
[ h_angle_0, h_angle_1, ..., h_angle_{h_num-1} ]
[ v_angle_0, v_angle_1, ..., v_angle_{v_num-1} ]
[ intensity[0][0..v_num-1], intensity[1][0..v_num-1], ... ]
```

Total size: `2 + h_num + v_num + h_num * v_num` floats.

