### 6.5 Layer 5 — GPU Buffer Layout & Upload

The IES GPU buffer follows the same layout as Cycles:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  OFFSET TABLE (one float per slot)                      │
│  data[i] = intBitsToFloat(byte_offset)                  │
│  data[i] = intBitsToFloat(-1) for invalid/empty slots   │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  PACKED IES DATA                                        │
│  [profile_0_packed][profile_1_packed]...                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**SSBO Binding:**

The IES buffer is bound as a `readonly buffer` in both the raytracing and forward shaders:

```glsl
layout(set = 0, binding = RT_IES_BUFFER_BINDING, std430) readonly buffer IESBuffer {
    float ies_data[];
};
```

