## 13. Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| RT_LightData size change breaks existing shaders | Compile errors, visual artifacts | `static_assert`, regenerate all `.gen.h` files, full rebuild |
| IES bicubic interpolation too expensive | GPU perf regression | Profile; degrade to bilinear for low-quality mode |
| Coordinate system mismatch (Y-up vs Z-up) | Wrong light distribution | Explicit test with known IES pattern, visual comparison |
| IES buffer unbounded growth | GPU OOM for many unique profiles | Cap slot count (e.g., 256), warn in editor |
| Thread safety in IESManager | Race conditions | Mutex on all slot operations (matches Cycles pattern) |
